<div class="container">
    <h1 class="doc-h1">INFRA-HA &mdash; .198 probed, disk cleared, 3rd node unlocked</h1>

    <div class="doc-muted last-updated">
        Last Updated: 2026-08-11 | Version: 1.00 | Author: shanta | Status: Infrastructure change (cleanup only, no app container touched)
    </div>

    <div id="toc" class="row doc-toc">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 class="doc-h2">Quick Navigation</h2>
            <div class="doc-navrow">
                <a href="#summary" class="doc-navlink">Summary</a>
